+<p>
+The order in which groups, elements, or targets appear does not indicate priority. If multiple targets for the same
+source concept have a priority order, define a mapping property such as <code>priority</code> and convey the ranking
+using an integer <code>ConceptMap.group.element.target.property.valueInteger</code>; see
+<a href="conceptmap-example-priority.html">Example map with priorities</a>.
 </p>
